# Collected hotel prices, at the repo-relative path the collector defaults to.
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `data/` also matches any nested
# directory called data — including src/lib/data/, which is where the code lives.
# Not committed: a wholesale rate feed is not ours to redistribute, and the file is
# an artefact. Regenerate with: npm run crawl:hotels
/data/
# Vercel CLI state: project link and, when login is run with --global-config,
# the auth token. Neither belongs in the repository.
.vercel/
.vercel-cli/
